---
lang: en
title: Showcases
description: Use cases, overlay solutions and payment form templates.
altUrl: /
---

{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}

{% block content %}
<div class="container">
    <div class="page-head">
        <h1>Showcases</h1>
        <p class="lead">
            Every example runs in a test environment — payments are simulated,
            so the whole purchase and settlement flow can be walked through to
            the end.
        </p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="section-title" id="usecases">Use cases</h2>
    <p class="lead">
        The same micropayment works for publisher content, digital file sales
        and billing inside apps.
    </p>
    <div class="de-cats">
        <section class="de-cat" aria-labelledby="cat-publishers">
            <h3 id="cat-publishers"><a href="/en/publisher/">Publishers</a></h3>
            <p class="de-cat__lede">Sell editorial content.</p>
            <ul class="de-cat__list">
                <li>
                    <a href="/en/publisher/unlock-article/">Unlock a single article</a>
                    <span class="de-cat__desc">A free opening, the rest after a micropayment.</span>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="/en/publisher/remove-ads/">Remove ads from the whole service for 24 hours</a>
                    <span class="de-cat__desc">An ad-free pass confirmed by text message.</span>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="de-cat" aria-labelledby="cat-ecommerce">
            <h3 id="cat-ecommerce"><a href="/en/digital-ecommerce/">Digital commerce</a></h3>
            <p class="de-cat__lede">A sample shop where you can buy, download and watch things.</p>
            <ul class="de-cat__list">
                <li>
                    <a href="/en/digital-ecommerce/download/">File downloads</a>
                    <span class="de-cat__desc">E-book, PDF report, music file and a high-resolution photo.</span>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="/en/digital-ecommerce/streaming/">Streaming</a>
                    <span class="de-cat__desc">An audiobook and a single video viewing.</span>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="de-cat" aria-labelledby="cat-saas">
            <h3 id="cat-saas"><a href="/en/saas/">SaaS</a></h3>
            <p class="de-cat__lede">In-app billing without cards or subscriptions.</p>
            <ul class="de-cat__list">
                <li>
                    <a href="/en/add-ons/">Basket add-ons</a>
                    <span class="de-cat__desc">A set of add-ons paid with one total.</span>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="/en/saas-licenses/">Selling plans</a>
                    <span class="de-cat__desc">Plans confirmed by text message, no forms.</span>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>
    </div>

    <h2 class="section-title" id="templates">Templates</h2>
    <p class="lead">
        Your payment form can look like this. These are examples from the
        GetViaMsg library — we will design the final form together with you.
    </p>
    <h3 class="section-title" id="templates-form">Payment form</h3>
    <div class="card-grid">
        <a class="card" href="/en/templates/drawer/">
            <h3>Drawer</h3>
            <p>A payment panel sliding in from the right.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/en/templates/modal/">
            <h3>Modal</h3>
            <p>A classic dialog in the centre of the screen.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/en/templates/simple/">
            <h3>Simple</h3>
            <p>A minimal form: price, QR code and SMS button.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/en/templates/circle/">
            <h3>Circle</h3>
            <p>A large button and a QR code revealed by consent.</p>
        </a>
    </div>

    <h3 class="section-title" id="templates-placements">Where the unlock call-to-action sits</h3>
    <p class="lead">
        The same call to action can sit in different places — from a card in the
        text to a full-screen overlay.
    </p>
    <div class="card-grid">
        <a class="card" href="/en/templates/placements/inline/">
            <h3>Inline card</h3>
            <p>Right where the free preview ends.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/en/templates/placements/overlay/">
            <h3>Overlay</h3>
            <p>Covers the content area over a dimmed backdrop.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/en/templates/placements/sticky-bottom/">
            <h3>Sticky bottom bar</h3>
            <p>A full-width bar pinned to the bottom of the window.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/en/templates/placements/sticky-right/">
            <h3>Sticky side card</h3>
            <p>A card at the right edge, vertically centred.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/en/templates/placements/widget/">
            <h3>Widget</h3>
            <p>A collapsible widget in the bottom-right corner.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/en/templates/placements/banner/">
            <h3>Top banner</h3>
            <p>A full-width bar pinned to the top of the window.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/en/templates/placements/drawer/">
            <h3>Side panel</h3>
            <p>An informational panel on the right; a bottom sheet on phones.</p>
        </a>
    </div>

    <h2 class="section-title" id="overlay">Overlay</h2>
    <p class="lead">
        No rebuild needed. The overlay works on your page as it is, and the
        content uncovers itself once the payment is made.
    </p>
    <div class="card-grid">
        <a class="card" href="/en/overlay/article-1/">
            <h3>The invisible checkout</h3>
            <p>A long article, access for 1.45 PLN.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/en/overlay/article-2/">
            <h3>The town that read the fine print</h3>
            <p>The text appears once paid. 2.50 PLN.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/en/overlay/article-3/">
            <h3>The last hand-made page</h3>
            <p>Access to the story for 2.00 PLN.</p>
        </a>
    </div>

</div>
{% endblock %}
